{"id":"n89227-1-3","stage":5,"title":"군 · (略敬)听话人为男性朋友或晚辈时","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89227-1-3-1","ko":"내가 군에게 여러모로 실례를 많이 했네.","zh":"我在很多方面都对你失礼了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"내가","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"군에게","meaning":"(略敬)听话人为男性朋友或晚辈时，用来指称对方。","explanation":"군：(略敬)听话人为男性朋友或晚辈时，用来指称对方。；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"군","audio":"/audio/c7dbb8e1c30050fa73cb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89227","senseId":"1","lemma":"군","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"여러모로","meaning":"各方面地，多方","explanation":"여러모로：各方面地，多方","readings":[{"term":"여러모로","audio":"/audio/907c41710a864b02935f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67699","senseId":"1","lemma":"여러모로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"실례를","meaning":"失礼","explanation":"실례：失礼；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"실례","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26872","senseId":"1","lemma":"실례","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"많이","meaning":"多","explanation":"많이：多","readings":[{"term":"많이","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66030","senseId":"1","lemma":"많이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"했네.","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"c7dbb8e1c30050fa","term":"군","zh":"(略敬)听话人为男性朋友或晚辈时，用来指称对方。","audio":"/audio/c7dbb8e1c30050fa73cb.mp3","entryId":"89227","definition":"(略敬)听话人为男性朋友或晚辈时，用来指称对方。","pronunciation":["군"]},{"id":"907c41710a864b02","term":"여러모로","zh":"各方面地，多方","audio":"/audio/907c41710a864b02935f.mp3","entryId":"67699","definition":"多个方面地。","pronunciation":["여러모로"]},{"id":"a093e7a78337b547","term":"실례","zh":"失礼","audio":"/audio/a093e7a78337b547c773.mp3","entryId":"26872","definition":"言行违背礼仪；或指那样的言行。","pronunciation":["실례"]},{"id":"1af2aeb1be04021c","term":"많이","zh":"多","audio":"/audio/1af2aeb1be04021c7be5.mp3","entryId":"66030","definition":"数、量、程度等超过一定标准地。","pronunciation":["마ː니"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d00e7e753075eccad2f5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89227-1-3-2","ko":"선생님, 아닙니다. 그런 말씀은 하지 마십시오.","zh":"老师，您千万别这么说。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"선생님,","meaning":"老师，教师","explanation":"선생님：老师，教师","readings":[{"term":"선생님","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62818","senseId":"1","lemma":"선생님","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아닙니다.","meaning":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","explanation":"아니다：表示“不是”的否定判断。；ㅂ니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"아닙니다","audio":"/audio/e8295c6b386a8f8d06ed.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"그런","meaning":"那种，那样","explanation":"그런：那种，那样","readings":[{"term":"그런","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60341","senseId":"1","lemma":"그런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말씀은","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"하지","meaning":"吃，喝","explanation":"하다：吃，喝；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"마십시오.","meaning":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","explanation":"말다：不要做、停止做（-지 말다）；시：主语敬语，尊敬动作或状态的主体。；ㅂ시오：正式敬语的请求或命令语尾；通常与시合成십시오。","readings":[{"term":"말다","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69296","senseId":"2","lemma":"말다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"daac5ca7b302bd9b","term":"선생님","zh":"老师，教师","audio":"/audio/daac5ca7b302bd9b404a.mp3","entryId":"62818","definition":"(敬语)教授学生的人。","pronunciation":["선생님"]},{"id":"d14f5bfb24390ed9","term":"그런","zh":"那种，那样","audio":"/audio/d14f5bfb24390ed9c4da.mp3","entryId":"60341","definition":"状态、模样、性质等那个样子的。","pronunciation":["그런"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"吃，喝","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进食或抽烟等。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"69296","definition":"不要做、停止做（-지 말다）","pronunciation":["말ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e71c4640dd7d1732f7c9.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.36,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=89227","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":154,"sequenceScore":3.0853,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我在很多方面都对你失礼了。","老师，您千万别这么说。","找到体现主题内涵的部分了吗？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["我在很多方面都对你失礼了。","老师，您千万别这么说。","找到体现主题内涵的部分了吗？"],"answer":1}]}
